OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested as university
OL,4,Abuildings cordoned off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested in connection
OL,7,Fwith reports of a suspicious item at a
OL,8,Fcity university.
OL,10,FA large police cordon had been put up
OL,11,Faround a section of Newcastle
OL,12,FUniversity, closing off streets
OL,13,Fsurrounding the Kings Road area of the
OL,14,Fcampus, including St Thomas' Street and
OL,15,FBrewery Lane.
OL,17,FStreets surrounding the university, as
OL,18,Fwell as the nearby Royal Victoria
OL,19,FInfirmary, had been taped off by the
OL,20,Fforce causing disruption on and around
OL,21,Fcampus.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
