OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested as university
OL,4,Abuildings cordoned off
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumbria Police said it was called
OL,7,Fto the site on Kings Road at 14:10 BST.
OL,8,FA cordon was put up but by 18:00 it had
OL,9,Fbeen lifted, apart from a section
OL,10,Foutside the university's Islamic
OL,11,FSociety.
